00:00:00,010 --> 00:01:33,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:01:40,146 --> 00:01:43,211
The ceremony already started.
Is Xiao Zhen still coming?

2
00:01:43,213 --> 00:01:45,164
She's not even replying.

3
00:01:45,166 --> 00:01:46,466
She'd come, right?

4
00:01:47,253 --> 00:01:48,783
Let's wait a bit longer.

5
00:01:54,112 --> 00:01:56,051
Let me show you something.

6
00:01:59,266 --> 00:02:01,676
Isn't this Yang Xiao Fan?

7
00:02:02,546 --> 00:02:04,816
What's he up to now?

8
00:02:04,818 --> 00:02:08,052
He got married last year.
They registered it in the Netherlands.

9
00:02:08,054 --> 00:02:09,824
- He married a foreigner?
- Yes.

10
00:02:10,756 --> 00:02:12,357
She's quite pretty.

11
00:02:13,995 --> 00:02:16,762
Did you know he used to like you?

12
00:02:20,699 --> 00:02:24,528
He was planning to confess to you,
but I stopped him.

13
00:02:24,530 --> 00:02:26,474
I didn't think he was good enough for you.

14
00:02:26,476 --> 00:02:29,809
No wonder he blocked me.

15
00:02:29,811 --> 00:02:34,119
Am I... a bit too arbitrary sometimes?

16
00:02:36,292 --> 00:02:39,715
Don't take every dirty work on yourself.

17
00:02:39,717 --> 00:02:41,486
Let me do it myself.

18
00:02:45,142 --> 00:02:46,937
Is she coming or not?

19
00:02:47,927 --> 00:02:51,280
Don't tell me she came and already left.

20
00:02:52,659 --> 00:02:54,378
Let's wait a bit more.

21
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,732
Alright.

22
00:02:57,503 --> 00:02:59,225
What if she doesn't show up?

23
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:02,120
Then we'll leave?

24
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:06,259
What if she shows up after we leave?

25
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,613
Then we can't leave.

26
00:03:10,695 --> 00:03:13,655
[Episode 13]
[The Love Is Long Overdue]

27
00:03:49,009 --> 00:03:52,559
[Fu Ming Yu]
A five-minute call?

28
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,800
And I was the one who called him?

29
00:03:55,985 --> 00:03:57,631
I'm screwed.

30
00:03:57,633 --> 00:03:59,499
What did I say?

31
00:04:01,812 --> 00:04:04,477
I shouldn't use my phone after drinking.

32
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:05,934
I'm so screwed.

33
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,712
What did I say?

34
00:04:16,926 --> 00:04:19,993
<i>I'll lock my phone when I drink from now on.</i>

35
00:04:32,352 --> 00:04:37,432
[Fu Ming Yu]
[Call duration: 05:00]

36
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,740
Thanks.

37
00:04:53,447 --> 00:04:57,260
<i>I'm about to make a major decision.</i>

38
00:04:57,262 --> 00:04:59,627
<i>I'm kicking you out.</i>

39
00:04:59,629 --> 00:05:01,801
<i>Kick you out of my head.</i>

40
00:05:01,803 --> 00:05:04,198
<i>I'm done thinking about you.</i>

41
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:06,199
<i>You jerk.</i>

42
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:28,199
[Training Schedule/ Recurrent Training]
[Instructor: Yue Yang/ Trainee: Ruan Si Xian]

43
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:33,196
Really?
Just one phone call, and he came back early?

44
00:05:35,186 --> 00:05:36,971
Interesting.

45
00:05:40,291 --> 00:05:42,210
Look, Bai Yang.

46
00:05:42,211 --> 00:05:45,541
I have some friends
who want to visit Hengshi Air.

47
00:05:45,542 --> 00:05:47,419
Could you arrange it for me?

48
00:05:47,421 --> 00:05:50,002
Have Ms. Ruan accompany them the whole time.

49
00:05:50,975 --> 00:05:55,029
He got slapped,
yet he came back early for one call.

50
00:05:55,031 --> 00:05:58,673
I want to see who she really is, right?

51
00:05:59,739 --> 00:06:01,232
That's all for today.

52
00:06:03,459 --> 00:06:06,659
Si Xian. Wait a moment. Let's talk.

53
00:06:07,799 --> 00:06:11,845
I really admire you.
You've made great progress lately.

54
00:06:11,847 --> 00:06:13,420
It's all thanks to your teaching.

55
00:06:13,422 --> 00:06:15,239
No. It's because you're talented.

56
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:18,634
How about this? Let's grab a late-night snack.

57
00:06:18,636 --> 00:06:21,504
I'll pass. I have to get up early tomorrow.

58
00:06:21,505 --> 00:06:24,919
Right. Then let's just grab
something quick outside.

59
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,847
It won't take long, okay?

60
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,339
- Ms. Jiang.
- Si Xian, wait.

61
00:06:48,195 --> 00:06:50,078
Ms. Jiang.

62
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,318
What are you doing here?

63
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:53,599
Bringing you a late-night snack, Captain Yue.

64
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,278
That's very thoughtful of you.

65
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:57,438
But you don't have to
go to such trouble next time.

66
00:06:57,439 --> 00:07:00,839
Only if you can come home earlier next time.

67
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:03,491
You two carry on. I'll head out first.

68
00:07:03,493 --> 00:07:05,053
Si Xian, I'll walk you out.

69
00:07:25,206 --> 00:07:27,425
Si Xian, I'll get straight to the point.

70
00:07:28,898 --> 00:07:31,838
Lately, Yue Yang and I have been dating.

71
00:07:33,265 --> 00:07:37,130
I know that because of the simulator training,

72
00:07:37,132 --> 00:07:39,677
you've been around him a lot lately.

73
00:07:39,679 --> 00:07:43,311
I hope that, if possible,
during the evenings...

74
00:07:43,313 --> 00:07:47,635
Actually, at all times, you can avoid Yue Yang.

75
00:07:48,428 --> 00:07:52,659
I'm sorry, Ms. Jiang. I can't do that.
The simulator is too hard to book.

76
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:56,759
Whenever I have time and there's a
slot available, I'll do my best to get it.

77
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:59,584
Because I cherish every minute of practice.

78
00:07:59,585 --> 00:08:04,417
You can rest assured.
Instructor Yue and I are just colleagues.

79
00:08:04,419 --> 00:08:06,670
A senior-junior relationship.

80
00:08:06,672 --> 00:08:09,696
Other than that, there's nothing between us.

81
00:08:09,698 --> 00:08:10,830
Si Xian.

82
00:08:11,547 --> 00:08:13,796
We've known each other for years.

83
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:18,318
Over the years, your transformation
has been obvious to everyone.

84
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:21,225
Three years ago,
you were the beauty of Hengshi Air.

85
00:08:21,227 --> 00:08:24,937
And now, you're our airline's star pilot.

86
00:08:24,939 --> 00:08:28,879
You're so beautiful. The men at our airline
must have their eyes on you.

87
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:31,504
As for Yue Yang, I know him very well.

88
00:08:31,505 --> 00:08:35,516
If he's ever crossed a line at work,

89
00:08:36,530 --> 00:08:38,543
I apologize to you on his behalf.

90
00:08:38,544 --> 00:08:43,966
However, I still hope
you can keep your distance from him.

91
00:08:46,117 --> 00:08:50,731
Ms. Jiang, what you've said
and worried about today is unnecessary.

92
00:08:50,732 --> 00:08:56,359
You might not know me very well,
but let me make this clear to you.

93
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:59,144
Of all the men I could date,
Yue Yang would be the last one.

94
00:08:59,145 --> 00:09:03,464
What you treasure is worthless to me.

95
00:09:03,465 --> 00:09:06,529
Instead of worrying about
your so-called boyfriend getting stolen,

96
00:09:06,530 --> 00:09:09,237
why don't you tell him
to stop being an instructor?

97
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:13,268
You might even run into him
with some other girl on a flight one day.

98
00:09:13,987 --> 00:09:16,530
Why don't you just tell him to quit?

99
00:09:16,531 --> 00:09:21,151
You know exactly what's making you
so insecure about your relationship.

100
00:09:21,152 --> 00:09:25,631
- I have plenty of confidence in it, okay?
- Then why did you come to me today?

101
00:09:30,126 --> 00:09:34,449
Ms. Jiang, if I fall in love one day,

102
00:09:34,450 --> 00:09:37,733
I will walk with him out in the open.

103
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:43,599
I wouldn't want us hiding in the shadows like
it's some dirty secret, especially not him.

104
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:46,639
I believe you give your all to love.

105
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:52,373
But you must realize the worst thing in love
is mistaking poison for a cure.

106
00:09:55,387 --> 00:09:58,831
Ruan Si Xian, who are you
to teach me about love?

107
00:09:58,833 --> 00:10:02,107
I know my relationship with Yue Yang
better than anyone.

108
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:07,802
Yes, I do worry, but that's because I care.

109
00:10:07,804 --> 00:10:09,834
I'm not like you.

110
00:10:10,543 --> 00:10:12,518
Mr. Fu is so good to you.

111
00:10:13,394 --> 00:10:15,464
He treats you like a treasure.

112
00:10:15,465 --> 00:10:20,119
Your love life and career
have gone smoothly all these years.

113
00:10:20,121 --> 00:10:21,624
You went straight to the top.

114
00:10:21,625 --> 00:10:25,286
Of course, you feel secure. But what about me?

115
00:10:30,667 --> 00:10:34,879
Whether Yue Yang loves you
or wants to be with you,

116
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:38,217
I believe you know better than anyone.

117
00:10:38,218 --> 00:10:41,559
Ms. Jiang, there's nothing wrong
with being cautious.

118
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:47,202
But if you spend all your love on defense,
then that love is questionable.

119
00:10:47,971 --> 00:10:52,038
True love shouldn't have you
walking on eggshells.

120
00:10:54,373 --> 00:10:56,772
I've said all I have to say.

121
00:10:58,279 --> 00:10:59,513
I'll be going now.

122
00:11:21,438 --> 00:11:23,149
I'm fine.

123
00:11:26,584 --> 00:11:28,575
What a wonderful surprise

124
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,699
you've given me.

125
00:11:31,587 --> 00:11:33,944
- I got it.
- What do you mean?

126
00:11:33,945 --> 00:11:35,953
You got what you wanted.

127
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,513
What?

128
00:11:38,514 --> 00:11:40,480
Why did you come here today?

129
00:11:42,374 --> 00:11:46,178
Well, I brought you food
from the place you've been craving.

130
00:11:46,179 --> 00:11:50,659
- I waited in line for a long--
- So now you're interfering with my work?

131
00:11:50,661 --> 00:11:52,805
- I didn't.
- Yes, you did.

132
00:11:52,807 --> 00:11:56,382
Starting tomorrow,
I'll cancel all my evening training sessions.

133
00:11:56,384 --> 00:11:58,088
I'll cancel my daytime flights too.

134
00:11:58,090 --> 00:12:00,830
Maybe I should just quit the airline.

135
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:08,109
- You heard what we said.
- Yes.

136
00:12:08,111 --> 00:12:09,700
You were being quite loud.

137
00:12:11,206 --> 00:12:13,079
You know I didn't mean it that way.

138
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,479
Then what did you mean?

139
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:18,260
As far as I'm concerned,
you've already affected our work today.

140
00:12:20,374 --> 00:12:23,999
- What do you mean "our"?
- Ruan Si Xian's and my work tonight.

141
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,533
I think I've made myself clear.

142
00:12:32,902 --> 00:12:34,955
Yue Yang.

143
00:12:34,956 --> 00:12:38,862
Ask yourself. Did I affect your work?

144
00:12:39,879 --> 00:12:42,645
Or did you have your own ulterior motives?

145
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:46,719
So I have ulterior motives?
How come I didn't know that?

146
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:49,840
Since you know me so well,
tell me what they are.

147
00:12:50,673 --> 00:12:54,678
All I feel right now is that
you are questioning my professionalism.

148
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:58,491
First, I've been flying for over a decade.

149
00:12:58,492 --> 00:13:00,636
I can separate work from my personal life.

150
00:13:00,637 --> 00:13:06,159
Second, I believe Ruan Si Xian
is an excellent pilot. I want to mentor her.

151
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:09,253
Third, if I ever did something that
made her uncomfortable,

152
00:13:09,254 --> 00:13:11,679
she could report it
to her supervisor or the president.

153
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:15,439
But she didn't.
That proves I didn't do anything inappropriate.

154
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:20,704
Fourth, I've always thought of you
as an outstanding and perfect woman.

155
00:13:20,705 --> 00:13:25,393
But today, your behavior...
really disappointed me.

156
00:13:25,395 --> 00:13:27,264
You've ruined your image in my mind.

157
00:13:27,265 --> 00:13:30,049
I just wanted you to care more about me.

158
00:13:30,050 --> 00:13:31,919
How should I show I care?

159
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,783
You used to share everything with me.

160
00:13:33,784 --> 00:13:35,768
What you were doing, where you were,

161
00:13:35,769 --> 00:13:39,079
anything fun you encountered,
anything nice you saw.

162
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:43,092
You would tell me everything.
But now, I can't seem to reach you.

163
00:13:43,093 --> 00:13:46,317
I send you messages,
and you only reply when you feel like it.

164
00:13:46,318 --> 00:13:48,519
No one at the airline
knows about our relationship.

165
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:52,624
Even today, I had to randomly see the schedule
to find out you were with Ruan Si Xian.

166
00:13:52,625 --> 00:13:56,679
Fine. So starting tomorrow, from the
moment I wake up, every person I meet--

167
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:59,559
You know that's not what I meant.
What more do you want me to do?

168
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:04,035
- Then what do you mean?
- I don't feel loved by you anymore!

169
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:17,939
Since I'm so terrible
and you can't feel my love, then let it be.

170
00:14:22,340 --> 00:14:23,708
I'm sorry.

171
00:14:24,546 --> 00:14:25,973
What did you say?

172
00:14:29,446 --> 00:14:31,142
I said I'm sorry.

173
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:40,308
Jiang Zi Yue, I don't think
you owe an apology to me,

174
00:14:40,310 --> 00:14:43,389
but to Ruan Si Xian,
whose work you disrupted today.

175
00:14:43,391 --> 00:14:45,362
I'm sorry. I won't do it again.

176
00:14:52,187 --> 00:14:56,490
Let's... Why don't we go home?

177
00:14:57,964 --> 00:14:59,985
How can you change so quickly?

178
00:14:59,986 --> 00:15:04,436
Some things are still unresolved between us.
I can't go home with you.

179
00:15:04,438 --> 00:15:06,117
We can talk when we get home.

180
00:15:06,119 --> 00:15:08,424
Yes, you can do that. But I can't.

181
00:15:08,425 --> 00:15:10,102
I haven't thought things through.

182
00:15:10,933 --> 00:15:12,987
Then what do you want me to do?

183
00:15:14,699 --> 00:15:15,967
I don't know either.

184
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:30,638
There you go again. That look again.
That look of disdain again.

185
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:33,119
Every single time we fight, I see it.

186
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:37,399
I'm wrong when I apologize.
I'm still wrong when I argue.

187
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,865
Have you ever respected me, Yue Yang?

188
00:15:39,866 --> 00:15:44,130
You always take everything I do for you
for granted, don't you?

189
00:15:44,131 --> 00:15:48,194
I even waited in line for so long today
to buy you your favorite food.

190
00:15:48,195 --> 00:15:50,866
- You couldn't even say thank you!
- Thank you.

191
00:15:52,230 --> 00:15:55,484
Thank you for buying me my favorite food.

192
00:16:03,472 --> 00:16:05,285
You know, sometimes...

193
00:16:06,307 --> 00:16:09,743
when you're not hungry,
and you're forced to eat anyway,

194
00:16:09,744 --> 00:16:12,452
you'll only feel... stuffed.

195
00:16:13,227 --> 00:16:16,431
It makes you uncomfortable.
That's how I feel right now.

196
00:16:19,211 --> 00:16:21,997
Go home on your own. I still have work to do.

197
00:17:00,227 --> 00:17:04,306
And over here is a display
of Hengshi Air's uniforms.

198
00:17:04,308 --> 00:17:07,119
As you can see, the first set
is our earliest design.

199
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:11,664
With the shoulder boards,
its overall style is military-inspired.

200
00:17:11,665 --> 00:17:16,954
The second set was used starting in 1992.
The style has changed significantly.

201
00:17:16,955 --> 00:17:19,660
The third set was introduced in 1998.

202
00:17:19,661 --> 00:17:24,461
This set was used the longest at our airline.
It's also our most iconic uniform.

203
00:17:24,462 --> 00:17:28,517
Back then, we specifically commissioned
a Hong Kong designer to create it.

204
00:17:28,519 --> 00:17:30,786
It's still in use today.

205
00:17:30,788 --> 00:17:35,812
By the way, "Captain" Ruan once worked
as an outstanding flight attendant.

206
00:17:35,813 --> 00:17:39,877
She used to wear this very uniform
when she worked.

207
00:17:39,878 --> 00:17:42,839
So seeing it again
must feel very nostalgic for her.

208
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:44,407
Yes.

209
00:17:44,408 --> 00:17:47,239
These three sets
each have their own characteristics.

210
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:52,223
The 1998 uniform was the first Chinese uniform
to win the Blue Sky Design Awards.

211
00:17:52,225 --> 00:17:56,381
It became the first award-winning
Chinese airline uniform.

212
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:07,079
[Ruan Si Xian]

213
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:08,782
<i>Lunch together?</i>

214
00:18:11,653 --> 00:18:13,233
<i>You're back?</i>

215
00:18:15,890 --> 00:18:19,182
<i>If I hadn't come back in time,
you'd have kicked me out.</i>

216
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:23,599
[Typing...]

217
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:24,760
[Ruan Si Xian: ?]

218
00:18:27,854 --> 00:18:31,450
<i>Let's have lunch together.
I have something to tell you.</i>

219
00:18:35,417 --> 00:18:40,573
<i>I can't. I'm with visitors.
They're trying the simulator later.</i>

220
00:18:48,070 --> 00:18:51,118
Bai Yang. Go to the training center.
It's an emergency.

221
00:18:51,119 --> 00:18:52,553
Okay. Let's go. Hurry.

222
00:18:56,205 --> 00:18:59,368
Welcome to Hengshi Air's
simulator training center.

223
00:18:59,370 --> 00:19:01,788
As you can see, there are four simulators here.

224
00:19:01,789 --> 00:19:06,239
The two in the middle
are newly introduced Z101 simulators.

225
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:11,723
Recently, our pilots completed
their training here.

226
00:19:11,725 --> 00:19:14,399
Moreover, these two are full-motion.

227
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:17,544
The experience inside
is the same as in a real plane.

228
00:19:17,545 --> 00:19:22,241
The other two were also newly introduced.
There are unique features.

229
00:19:22,242 --> 00:19:23,719
- Look at that one.
- Look inside.

230
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,759
- Mr. Fu, you're here too.
- Yes.

231
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:28,008
Let's continue. This way, please.

232
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:33,143
I'm surprised Mr. Fu is accompanying us.

233
00:19:33,144 --> 00:19:35,168
I must be quite honored.

234
00:19:35,169 --> 00:19:36,953
Mrs. He, you came in person.

235
00:19:36,954 --> 00:19:39,764
We cannot afford to be negligent.

236
00:19:39,766 --> 00:19:41,446
Thank you, Mr. Fu.

237
00:19:45,492 --> 00:19:47,328
Why are you here?

238
00:19:47,330 --> 00:19:49,162
Am I not allowed to be here?

239
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:51,371
I wouldn't dare say that.

240
00:19:51,372 --> 00:19:52,438
This way.

241
00:19:52,439 --> 00:19:54,891
Everyone, this way, please.

242
00:19:54,893 --> 00:19:56,852
This way. This is the lounge.

243
00:19:56,853 --> 00:19:59,479
- Follow me.
- Let's take a short break.

244
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:02,118
Let's take a break.
Try Hengshi Air's coffee and see how it is.

245
00:20:02,119 --> 00:20:03,558
- Right.
- This way, please.

246
00:20:03,559 --> 00:20:05,278
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

247
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:07,558
- Welcome. Long time no see.
- Please, have a seat.

248
00:20:07,559 --> 00:20:08,639
- Sit.
- I really am a bit tired.

249
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:10,875
- Have a seat. Over here.
- Tired indeed.

250
00:20:15,337 --> 00:20:19,087
Ms. Ruan. Come and sit with us.

251
00:20:22,592 --> 00:20:24,991
- That wouldn't be appropriate.
- It's fine.

252
00:20:24,992 --> 00:20:28,448
Exactly. What's inappropriate about it?
Come here.

253
00:20:28,449 --> 00:20:30,991
I have something to discuss with you. Come.

254
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:48,978
Ms. Ruan, do you have a boyfriend?

255
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,825
I'm just asking.

256
00:20:52,911 --> 00:20:56,765
At my age, I love to gossip about these things.

257
00:20:58,154 --> 00:20:59,405
Not yet.

258
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:03,759
Well, Ms. Ruan, you must not be in a hurry.

259
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:06,891
You're young, beautiful, and talented as well.

260
00:21:06,892 --> 00:21:09,474
You must have many suitors.

261
00:21:09,476 --> 00:21:10,942
Not really.

262
00:21:10,943 --> 00:21:14,079
My social circle is quite small.

263
00:21:14,081 --> 00:21:16,723
And I'm usually quite busy.

264
00:21:17,563 --> 00:21:19,864
But you can't let work get in the way.

265
00:21:19,865 --> 00:21:23,488
You don't have to rush into marriage.

266
00:21:23,489 --> 00:21:26,079
But you should start seeing someone.

267
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:29,102
Think of it as a pastime from work.

268
00:21:30,494 --> 00:21:33,470
Later on, I'll help you find someone.

269
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:38,071
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it. It's no trouble.

270
00:21:42,446 --> 00:21:47,960
I have a son who is around your age.

271
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:51,519
He's quite handsome.

272
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:54,874
He helps out with the family business.

273
00:21:54,876 --> 00:21:58,248
As for his personality, it could be better.

274
00:21:58,249 --> 00:22:00,673
He's very dull. Doesn't talk much.

275
00:22:00,674 --> 00:22:03,659
And when he does speak,
it's not very pleasant to hear.

276
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:05,719
He might as well stay silent.

277
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,609
But my son is quite generous with his money.
He's very open-handed.

278
00:22:10,610 --> 00:22:14,529
Everyone has their own good points, right?

279
00:22:15,919 --> 00:22:18,979
What do you think?
Are you interested, Ms. Ruan?

280
00:22:22,213 --> 00:22:26,439
I'm sorry.
I haven't really thought about dating.

281
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:30,042
And I'm indeed pretty busy.
I'm afraid I won't have time to date.

282
00:22:32,337 --> 00:22:34,954
Then you should find someone at work.

283
00:22:34,955 --> 00:22:37,519
It'll be easier to spend time together, right?

284
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:39,148
True.

285
00:22:39,150 --> 00:22:42,239
By the way, Mr. Fu seems to be single, right?

286
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:43,771
Yes.

287
00:22:43,773 --> 00:22:45,638
What do you think of him?

288
00:22:48,432 --> 00:22:51,294
- I don't think much of him.
- What?

289
00:22:55,883 --> 00:22:58,679
Have I ever been your boyfriend?

290
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:03,115
How can you judge that I'd be a bad boyfriend?

291
00:23:03,117 --> 00:23:07,079
To judge how well a refrigerator works,
do I have to freeze inside it for two days?

292
00:23:07,080 --> 00:23:09,278
Theoretically, yes.

293
00:23:13,397 --> 00:23:16,931
Don't talk nonsense in front of our guest.
Mind your image.

294
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:20,025
- I'm sorry, Mrs. He.
- It's fine.

295
00:23:20,026 --> 00:23:21,979
We'll talk about this tonight.

296
00:23:26,225 --> 00:23:30,418
Since you're here at Hengshi Air,
you must try our canteen.

297
00:23:30,419 --> 00:23:31,884
We serve different cuisines every day.

298
00:23:31,885 --> 00:23:33,679
- All eight major Chinese cuisines.
- Really?

299
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:37,171
We even have private kitchens.
Everyone, let's go upstairs and dig in.

300
00:23:37,172 --> 00:23:39,756
- Then I must give it a try.
- Absolutely.

301
00:23:39,757 --> 00:23:44,079
"Captain" Ruan, do you usually eat here too?
You probably don't have time to cook.

302
00:23:44,080 --> 00:23:45,488
Occasionally.

303
00:23:46,114 --> 00:23:47,467
After you.

304
00:23:50,090 --> 00:23:52,264
- Come on in.
- This way, everyone.

305
00:23:52,265 --> 00:23:53,799
- Thank you.
- Watch your step.

306
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:55,239
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

307
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:59,039
- Make sure you enjoy our food later.
- Okay.

308
00:23:59,040 --> 00:24:02,199
Ms. He, were you okay
in the simulator just now?

309
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,905
I'm okay.

310
00:24:03,906 --> 00:24:07,886
But... I almost fainted from laughing.

311
00:24:26,033 --> 00:24:27,838
Everyone, this way, please.

312
00:24:27,839 --> 00:24:30,278
- This way, come on.
- Hello, we serve coffee here.

313
00:24:30,279 --> 00:24:32,440
- This way.
- Come on, Ruan--

314
00:24:56,978 --> 00:24:58,948
What are you laughing at?

315
00:24:58,950 --> 00:25:01,115
Can't I laugh if I'm happy?

316
00:25:01,116 --> 00:25:04,799
- Just now, in the elevator--
- What is it?

317
00:25:06,810 --> 00:25:10,022
Just now, I was suddenly grabbed by--

318
00:25:10,024 --> 00:25:11,849
I grabbed the wrong person.

319
00:25:11,850 --> 00:25:13,554
- I thought...
- You thought what?

320
00:25:13,555 --> 00:25:14,959
I thought you were Mrs. He.

321
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:17,679
You knew I grabbed the wrong person,
yet you didn't let go.

322
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:19,824
Are you always this easy?

323
00:25:19,825 --> 00:25:24,074
You didn't even check and just grabbed
anyone's hand. Which of us is easier?

324
00:25:24,075 --> 00:25:28,498
Besides, I didn't know
if you actually wanted to hold my hand.

325
00:25:28,499 --> 00:25:31,243
Didn't you call me to say that you missed me?

326
00:25:31,244 --> 00:25:32,244
I...

327
00:25:33,610 --> 00:25:36,759
Let go. Don't talk nonsense.

328
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:40,403
I was drunk that day. I didn't mean it.
You can't take it seriously.

329
00:25:41,040 --> 00:25:42,661
From what I know of you,

330
00:25:43,763 --> 00:25:47,507
you usually speak the truth when you're drunk.

331
00:25:47,509 --> 00:25:50,092
You talk as if you know me so well.

332
00:25:50,093 --> 00:25:55,336
I might not know you well enough yet,
but I know myself.

333
00:26:01,893 --> 00:26:03,740
I like you.

334
00:26:12,025 --> 00:26:16,719
You don't like me.
You like the idea of a female captain.

335
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:19,550
I don't have some kind of filter over pilots.

336
00:26:21,133 --> 00:26:22,921
But I have one for you.

337
00:26:24,611 --> 00:26:27,835
Fu Ming Yu, what exactly do you want?

338
00:26:27,836 --> 00:26:29,900
- Let go.
- Ruan Si Xian.

339
00:26:29,901 --> 00:26:31,991
I want to be your boyfriend.

340
00:26:33,378 --> 00:26:35,772
Even if you let me keep dreaming,

341
00:26:37,694 --> 00:26:41,163
usually my dreams come true.

342
00:26:41,164 --> 00:26:42,829
As if I'd believe your nonsense.

343
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:44,707
You don't have to believe me,

344
00:26:45,701 --> 00:26:47,747
but you have to believe yourself.

345
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:53,108
And if you feel the same way, we could...

346
00:26:53,110 --> 00:26:55,279
Am I a masochist?

347
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:58,399
Why would I like someone who ignores me
when he's on a business trip,

348
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,504
then treats me
like I'm at his beck and call when--

349
00:27:00,505 --> 00:27:02,519
I wasn't ignoring you.

350
00:27:02,520 --> 00:27:06,039
I was afraid that if I reached out,
all my efforts would be in vain.

351
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:09,663
That's why I put everything aside
and came back to see you.

352
00:27:16,254 --> 00:27:17,937
Let go.

353
00:27:20,192 --> 00:27:21,908
Lean your face in.

354
00:27:23,240 --> 00:27:24,597
Your face.

355
00:27:33,647 --> 00:27:36,136
Stop reading those cheesy pick-up lines.

356
00:27:39,477 --> 00:27:42,722
So, are we together? Do you want to be with me?

357
00:27:43,520 --> 00:27:45,739
Hey. Do you want to be with me or not?

358
00:27:46,833 --> 00:27:48,149
Si Xian.

359
00:28:02,697 --> 00:28:06,602
I don't know
if Fu Ming Yu's been possessed lately.

360
00:28:06,604 --> 00:28:08,605
He's acting so strange.

361
00:28:11,201 --> 00:28:13,065
He came to the company today.

362
00:28:13,914 --> 00:28:16,008
And he suddenly--

363
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:25,619
This... What's wrong?

364
00:28:26,671 --> 00:28:29,358
- Lu Ming is gone.
- Gone?

365
00:28:29,359 --> 00:28:31,824
Where did he go?
He just left Xiao Zhen behind?

366
00:28:31,825 --> 00:28:34,288
I told you. That guy is unreliable.

367
00:28:34,289 --> 00:28:37,599
Tell me where he went.
I'm going to find him wherever he is.

368
00:28:37,600 --> 00:28:38,879
That scumbag.

369
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:41,267
- Stop asking.
- Why can't I?

370
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,989
Lu Ming...

371
00:28:44,562 --> 00:28:46,255
He passed away.

372
00:28:47,833 --> 00:28:48,969
Pa--

373
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:51,211
It'll be fine.

374
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:55,820
I'll never see him again.

375
00:29:00,239 --> 00:29:03,535
What am I going to do?

376
00:29:03,536 --> 00:29:07,119
What am I going to do?

377
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:09,223
There, there. Don't cry.

378
00:29:37,958 --> 00:29:42,664
Let's go. We can't wait anymore.
I feel like she still can't face it.

379
00:29:44,811 --> 00:29:46,851
Let's go.

380
00:29:54,299 --> 00:29:56,839
I'm sorry I'm late.

381
00:29:58,338 --> 00:30:00,537
You're not late at all. Let's go.

382
00:31:01,305 --> 00:31:03,667
Mom, this is Lu Ming's girlfriend.

383
00:31:03,668 --> 00:31:05,165
Hello, ma'am.

384
00:31:59,900 --> 00:32:01,392
Hi.

385
00:32:03,164 --> 00:32:04,508
Lu Ming.

386
00:32:06,871 --> 00:32:10,406
I'm sorry. I'm late again today.

387
00:32:11,753 --> 00:32:14,334
My makeup was so hard to do today.

388
00:32:15,088 --> 00:32:19,066
It kept smudging, so I had to keep redoing it.

389
00:32:22,568 --> 00:32:23,906
Look.

390
00:32:25,065 --> 00:32:28,687
Today, I'm cosplaying as Zhi again.

391
00:32:29,493 --> 00:32:32,236
I hope you'll always remember...

392
00:32:33,266 --> 00:32:36,016
what I looked like the first time we met.

393
00:32:54,050 --> 00:32:59,879
I only found out later that
when you were in the sea that day,

394
00:32:59,880 --> 00:33:03,166
my flight was passing right over that area.

395
00:33:05,381 --> 00:33:08,369
Why didn't I look down at the ocean?

396
00:33:11,934 --> 00:33:13,655
I've always felt that...

397
00:33:14,313 --> 00:33:17,880
I was an incredibly lucky person.

398
00:33:19,165 --> 00:33:20,990
Because I met you.

399
00:33:24,147 --> 00:33:27,132
If I had known how unpredictable life is,

400
00:33:28,153 --> 00:33:32,817
I wouldn't have kept myself
from saying "I like you".

401
00:33:37,537 --> 00:33:39,505
These past two days...

402
00:33:40,157 --> 00:33:43,618
I've been thinking about
the time we spent together.

403
00:33:45,796 --> 00:33:47,467
I did the math.

404
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:53,719
I had exactly 27 chances
to tell you how I felt.

405
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:55,885
But I never did.

406
00:33:55,886 --> 00:34:01,318
Because I thought...
we had all the time in the world.

407
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:04,672
There'd always be another chance to tell you.

408
00:34:04,674 --> 00:34:06,674
But I never expected...

409
00:34:08,066 --> 00:34:10,120
we'd run out of our time so soon.

410
00:34:11,117 --> 00:34:17,060
Each of those 27 moments
was already a perfect chance.

411
00:34:17,061 --> 00:34:20,881
I was the one
who pushed you and our happiness away.

412
00:34:24,107 --> 00:34:25,547
Lu Ming.

413
00:34:28,409 --> 00:34:30,327
I like you.

414
00:34:32,341 --> 00:34:34,815
I'm sure you can hear me.

415
00:34:36,522 --> 00:34:38,106
My dear Lu Ming,

416
00:34:38,107 --> 00:34:42,852
I hope you can take my love
and my longing with you.

417
00:34:42,853 --> 00:34:44,483
I believe that

418
00:34:45,245 --> 00:34:49,697
on the Green Continent
of "Age of Scorched Earth,"

419
00:34:50,720 --> 00:34:54,500
those who miss each other
will eventually reunite.

420
00:34:57,794 --> 00:34:58,900
Lu Ming.

421
00:35:00,725 --> 00:35:02,026
Thank you.

422
00:35:15,842 --> 00:35:18,746
Xiao Zhen, there's a video here.

423
00:35:18,747 --> 00:35:21,280
I think you should watch it.

424
00:35:25,057 --> 00:35:27,601
<i>Hi, Xiao Zhen. Guess where I am?</i>

425
00:35:27,602 --> 00:35:31,274
<i>Right now, I'm at the Gold Coast in Queensland.</i>

426
00:35:31,275 --> 00:35:33,963
<i>It's absolutely beautiful here.
Let me show you.</i>

427
00:35:36,496 --> 00:35:39,420
<i>Yesterday, I was here watching the sunset.</i>

428
00:35:40,114 --> 00:35:42,699
<i>And suddenly, I felt a bit sentimental.</i>

429
00:35:42,700 --> 00:35:46,279
<i>Because I was thinking,
with scenery this beautiful,</i>

430
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:48,791
<i>why aren't you here by my side?</i>

431
00:35:51,094 --> 00:35:55,067
<i>I can't hold back my feelings for you anymore.</i>

432
00:35:55,068 --> 00:35:58,741
<i>Because I really, really want to see you.
I miss you so much.</i>

433
00:36:03,389 --> 00:36:04,740
<i>Si Xiao Zhen.</i>

434
00:36:06,933 --> 00:36:08,212
<i>I like you.</i>

435
00:36:09,779 --> 00:36:12,098
<i>Will you be my girlfriend?</i>

436
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:17,380
He... He said he liked me.

437
00:36:18,194 --> 00:36:20,778
<i>- Si Xiao Zhen.</i>
- He said he liked me.

438
00:36:20,779 --> 00:36:22,399
<i>If possible,</i>

439
00:36:23,619 --> 00:36:26,803
<i>I want to see countless sunrises
and sunsets with you.</i>

440
00:36:26,804 --> 00:36:29,904
He liked me.

441
00:36:33,965 --> 00:36:36,995
I like you too.

442
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:57,520
[Mingchen Residences]

443
00:37:40,346 --> 00:37:45,304
- Eat something. You barely ate all day.
- I really can't eat. I have no appetite.

444
00:37:45,305 --> 00:37:47,568
Go back to the pub. I'll stay here.

445
00:37:47,569 --> 00:37:50,602
It's okay. Tong Le is there.

446
00:37:51,508 --> 00:37:54,982
It's hard for her to get time off.
I asked Ni Tong to swap shifts with her.

447
00:37:54,984 --> 00:37:57,334
Let her stay here tonight.

448
00:38:04,040 --> 00:38:05,429
Here.

449
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,464
What's this?

450
00:38:08,466 --> 00:38:11,452
An invitation to the opening ceremony
of Zheng You An's studio.

451
00:38:11,454 --> 00:38:12,986
Are you going?

452
00:38:14,873 --> 00:38:18,838
We'll see.
I'm not in the mood for this right now.

453
00:38:20,898 --> 00:38:22,318
Xuan.

454
00:38:23,060 --> 00:38:26,120
Today, I've been thinking about something.

455
00:38:28,529 --> 00:38:31,946
If we hadn't tried so hard to stop her,

456
00:38:31,948 --> 00:38:34,452
if we hadn't kept discouraging her,

457
00:38:34,454 --> 00:38:37,291
would things have turned out differently?

458
00:38:42,173 --> 00:38:45,207
We both thought we knew better.

459
00:38:46,405 --> 00:38:48,363
We even lectured her.

460
00:38:50,551 --> 00:38:52,554
But look at Xiao Zhen.

461
00:38:52,556 --> 00:38:55,944
She liked him, and she expressed it bravely.

462
00:38:55,945 --> 00:38:58,679
If we hadn't given her bad advice,

463
00:38:58,680 --> 00:39:01,431
they would've known their feelings were mutual.

464
00:39:01,433 --> 00:39:04,572
Wouldn't they have been closer and happier?

465
00:39:09,757 --> 00:39:11,366
But me?

466
00:39:12,359 --> 00:39:14,878
I'm always overthinking things.

467
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:16,784
One moment, I find it too troublesome.

468
00:39:16,786 --> 00:39:19,458
The next, I'm worried about what others think.

469
00:39:19,460 --> 00:39:22,644
I keep thinking about it,
but never get anywhere.

470
00:39:22,646 --> 00:39:24,630
So I just run away.

471
00:39:24,632 --> 00:39:26,588
Xiao Zhen is brave.

472
00:39:29,859 --> 00:39:32,634
It's us who have lost the courage
to try and fail.

473
00:39:32,636 --> 00:39:35,026
But so what if we fail?

474
00:39:35,631 --> 00:39:39,584
Isn't failing better than missing out?

475
00:39:46,105 --> 00:39:47,985
I don't know.

476
00:39:49,245 --> 00:39:54,333
When it comes to life and relationships,
I really don't know either.

477
00:39:57,747 --> 00:40:02,046
But if you like him, why not give it a shot?

478
00:40:06,615 --> 00:40:08,150
Xuan.

479
00:40:10,254 --> 00:40:15,553
Actually, I'm very attracted... to Fu Ming Yu.

480
00:40:19,287 --> 00:40:24,075
He keeps coming toward me with such certainty.

481
00:40:25,119 --> 00:40:27,288
I've started wanting more.

482
00:40:28,082 --> 00:40:31,695
I enjoy his care for me and his kindness.

483
00:40:33,147 --> 00:40:34,705
Xuan.

484
00:40:34,707 --> 00:40:38,861
Maybe I'm affected by my parents' relationship.

485
00:40:38,862 --> 00:40:43,643
The closer love gets,
the more I'm afraid of losing it.

486
00:40:43,645 --> 00:40:44,874
You silly girl.

487
00:40:47,563 --> 00:40:52,388
I can't just blindly encourage you to leap.

488
00:40:52,390 --> 00:40:53,951
But I believe that...

489
00:40:54,969 --> 00:40:56,548
if it's the right person,

490
00:40:57,374 --> 00:41:02,268
then his waiting will surely become
your growing courage.

491
00:41:02,269 --> 00:41:06,222
If you've made up your mind,
go and embrace him.

492
00:41:07,402 --> 00:41:11,221
Maybe the love meant for you is long overdue.

493
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:02,552
What about this piece?

494
00:42:02,553 --> 00:42:05,919
Come on in.
Let's go inside and broaden your horizons.

495
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,301
Go.

496
00:42:12,554 --> 00:42:14,439
Not bad.

497
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,479
You've made wonders with so little money.

498
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:18,624
I'm warning you. Don't ruin my mood today.

499
00:42:18,625 --> 00:42:22,079
Or on this auspicious day,
I'll send you straight to your grave.

500
00:42:22,080 --> 00:42:26,004
Watch your mouth. I'm here to congratulate you.
And this is how you talk to me?

501
00:42:26,006 --> 00:42:27,332
Where's Fu Ming Yu?

502
00:42:28,027 --> 00:42:31,319
I sent him an invitation.
It's his loss if he doesn't come.

503
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:33,598
Then why did I have to come?
Talk about double standards.

504
00:42:33,599 --> 00:42:36,079
So what if I am?
How come they only apply to you?

505
00:42:36,080 --> 00:42:37,873
Figure it out yourself.

506
00:42:38,780 --> 00:42:40,271
Mom.

507
00:42:40,273 --> 00:42:42,744
Congratulations on the opening, Boss Zheng.

508
00:42:42,745 --> 00:42:43,799
Where's my dad?

509
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:46,079
Don't even ask. He's at home sulking over you.

510
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:47,718
He said you didn't invite him.

511
00:42:47,719 --> 00:42:49,759
He's being dramatic. Let me show you around.

512
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:52,904
No need. Go attend to your guests.
I'll look around myself.

513
00:42:52,905 --> 00:42:55,848
- Call me if you need anything, Mom.
- Okay.

514
00:42:57,530 --> 00:43:00,946
Si Xian. I knew you wouldn't miss this.

515
00:43:00,948 --> 00:43:03,578
Congratulations on the opening.
I'm a practical person.

516
00:43:03,580 --> 00:43:05,628
I didn't know what to get you.

517
00:43:07,048 --> 00:43:08,138
Here's a little something.

518
00:43:08,140 --> 00:43:12,580
This red envelope is exactly what I wanted.

519
00:43:13,267 --> 00:43:15,832
I need money the most right now.

520
00:43:15,834 --> 00:43:19,758
Go ahead and look around.
I have a gift for you later, too.

